<view class="page">

  <!-- 棋盘只读：打谱不改棋谱，落子能力留给对弈/分析模式（8×8 view 网格，不依赖 Canvas）。 -->
  <board-view
    wx:if="{{hasGame}}"
    cells="{{cells}}"
    boardSize="{{boardSize}}"
    cellSize="{{cellSize}}"
    pieceFont="{{pieceFont}}"
    labelFont="{{labelFont}}"
    evalPercent="{{evalPercent}}"
  />

  <scroll-view scroll-y class="body" scroll-into-view="{{tabAnchor}}">
    <view id="{{tabAnchor}}" class="anchor"></view>

    <!-- 空状态：还没导入棋谱时，页面只有一句话 + 导入卡 -->
    <view wx:if="{{!hasGame}}" class="card intro">
      <text class="intro-title">打谱</text>
      <text class="intro-sub muted">粘贴一段 PGN，逐步回放并让引擎标注每一步；AI 点评里的分支可以直接点开演示。</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 棋谱信息 + 当前步 -->
    <view wx:if="{{hasGame}}" class="card info-card">
      <view class="row head">
        <text class="section-title">{{gameTitle}}</text>
        <view class="gap"></view>
        <text class="muted tiny">{{stepNo}}/{{stepTotal}}</text>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{gameMeta}}" class="muted tiny">{{gameMeta}}</text>
      <view class="row step-row">
        <text class="step-label">{{stepLabel}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{inVariation}}" class="tag-variation">变例</text>
        <view class="gap"></view>
        <view class="chip" bindtap="onGotoEnd">跳到末尾</view>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{pathLine}}" class="tech-detail">{{pathLine}}</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 分支选择：只有当前局面存在多条续着时才出现（单线局面用「前进」就够了） -->
    <view wx:if="{{hasGame && branchPoint}}" class="card">
      <view class="row head">
        <text class="section-title">此局面的续着</text>
        <view class="gap"></view>
        <text class="muted tiny">点一下跳到该分支</text>
      </view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view
          wx:for="{{childOptions}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="chip {{item.main ? 'chip-ok' : ''}}"
          data-node="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="onGotoNode"
        >{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 状态条：后退/前进 = 上一步/下一步；重置 = 回到起始局面 -->
    <session-bar
      wx:if="{{hasGame}}"
      statusLabel="{{statusLabel}}"
      statusTone="{{statusTone}}"
      turnClass="{{turnClass}}"
      flipped="{{flipped}}"
      evalLabel="{{evalLabel}}"
      terminalLabel="{{terminalLabel}}"
      canUndo="{{canUndo}}"
      canRedo="{{canRedo}}"
      bind:undo="onStepBack"
      bind:redo="onStepForward"
      bind:reset="onReset"
      bind:flip="onFlip"
    />

    <!-- 每步引擎标注 -->
    <engine-panel
      wx:if="{{hasGame && activeTabKey === 'engine'}}"
      engineLabel="{{engineLabel}}"
      engineSource="{{engineSource}}"
      analyzing="{{analyzing}}"
      depthOptions="{{depthOptions}}"
      depthIndex="{{depthIndex}}"
      analysisLines="{{analysisLines}}"
      analysisError="{{analysisError}}"
      engineNotice="{{engineNotice}}"
      bind:depthchange="onDepthChange"
      bind:analyze="onAnalyze"
      bind:linepreview="onPreviewLine"
    />

    <!-- 云端 AI 点评：分支可点，进入演示后不影响棋谱位置 -->
    <comment-card
      wx:if="{{hasGame && activeTabKey === 'coach'}}"
      cloudReady="{{cloudReady}}"
      commenting="{{commenting}}"
      commentingHint="{{commentingHint}}"
      coachText="{{coachText}}"
      coachError="{{coachError}}"
      cloudHint="{{cloudHint}}"
      coachModel="{{coachModel}}"
      coachSegments="{{coachSegments}}"
      demoLines="{{demoLines}}"
      demoActive="{{demoActive}}"
      demoBreadcrumb="{{demoBreadcrumb}}"
      demoPlaying="{{demoPlaying}}"
      demoCanBack="{{demoCanBack}}"
      demoCanForward="{{demoCanForward}}"
      coachDetail="{{coachDetail}}"
      debugEnabled="{{debugEnabled}}"
      bind:coach="onCoach"
      bind:copy="onCopyCoach"
      bind:coachlongpress="onCoachLongPress"
      bind:coachtokentap="onCoachTokenTap"
      bind:demoenter="onEnterDemo"
      bind:demostep="onDemoStep"
      bind:demoplay="onDemoPlay"
      bind:demoexit="onDemoExit"
      bind:linelongpress="onLineLongPress"
    />

    <!-- 走子记录：打谱模式下每一步可点定位（当前所在那一手高亮） -->
    <move-list
      wx:if="{{hasGame && activeTabKey === 'moves'}}"
      moveRows="{{moveRows}}"
      moveCount="{{moveCount}}"
      interactive="{{true}}"
      bind:movetap="onGotoNode"
    />

    <!-- 调试面板 -->
    <view wx:if="{{debugEnabled}}" class="card">
      <view class="row head">
        <text class="section-title">调试面板</text>
        <view class="gap"></view>
        <view class="btn small" bindtap="onToggleDebug">{{debugOpen ? '收起' : '展开'}}</view>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{analysisMeta}}" class="tech-detail">{{analysisMeta}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{!debugOpen}}" class="muted tiny">出错时把这里的内容复制出来，就能看到失败在哪一步（共 {{debugCount}} 条）。</text>
      <view wx:if="{{debugOpen}}" class="log-actions">
        <view class="btn small" bindtap="onCopyDebug">复制全部</view>
        <view class="btn small" bindtap="onClearDebug">清空</view>
        <view class="btn small" bindtap="onToggleEnableDebug">{{debugEnabled ? '关闭真机调试面板' : '打开真机调试面板'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{debugOpen}}" class="log-box">
        <view wx:for="{{debugRows}}" wx:key="key" class="log-row">
          <text class="log-time">{{item.time}}</text>
          <text class="log-level level-{{item.level}}">{{item.level}}</text>
          <text class="log-text">{{item.text}}</text>
        </view>
        <text wx:if="{{!debugRows.length}}" class="muted tiny">暂无日志。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 导入 PGN：有棋谱后折叠，随时可以换一盘 -->
    <view class="card import-card">
      <view class="row head" bindtap="onToggleImport">
        <text class="section-title">导入 PGN</text>
        <view class="gap"></view>
        <text class="muted tiny">{{pgnCollapsed ? '展开 ▾' : '收起 ▴'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{!pgnCollapsed}}">
        <textarea
          class="pgn-input"
          value="{{pgnInput}}"
          placeholder="粘贴 PGN，例如 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 …（支持 [Event] 头与 (变例)）"
          placeholder-class="pgn-placeholder"
          maxlength="-1"
          bindinput="onPgnInput"
        />
        <view class="row pgn-actions">
          <view class="btn primary" bindtap="onImport">载入</view>
          <view class="chip" bindtap="onUseSample">填入示例</view>
          <view class="chip" bindtap="onPastePgn">从剪贴板载入</view>
        </view>
        <text wx:if="{{importError}}" class="error">{{importError}}</text>
        <text wx:else class="muted tiny">{{pgnHint}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <!-- Tab 栏：与 analyze/play 一致的 3 Tab（≤3 轮、不新增底部 tabBar） -->
  <view wx:if="{{hasGame}}" class="tabs">
    <view
      wx:for="{{tabs}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="tab {{activeTabKey === item.key ? 'tab-active' : ''}}"
      data-tab="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="onSwitchTab"
    >
      <text class="tab-label">{{item.label}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
